[00:15.64]1. Our reasons for joy are abundant,
[00:19.64]Like riches increasing in worth.
[00:25.15]Those precious to God from all nations
[00:29.50]Are joining us in all the earth.
[00:34.94]The joy in our heart is well-founded,
[00:39.64]With roots reaching deep in God’s Word.
[00:44.64]We daily partake of its teachings;
[00:49.44]Faith follows the things we have heard.
[01:01.82]Our causes for joy are deep-seated,
[01:06.38]Like embers that burn in our hearts.
[01:11.42]Though troubles and trials beset us,
[01:13.90]Endurance Jehovah imparts.
[01:16.38](Chorus)
[01:18.86]Jehovah our God is our joy,
[01:21.34]The work of his hands our delight.
[01:25.96]How deep are his thoughts, how great are his works,
[01:33.16]Abounding in goodness and might!
[01:50.40]2. We gladly behold his productions,
[01:54.68]The heavens, the sea, and the land.
[01:59.71]We gaze at the book of creation,
[02:04.35]Applauding the work of his hands.
[02:09.12]Triumphantly we now bear witness,
[02:13.84]Proclaiming the Kingdom of God.
[02:18.64]The news of its birth and its blessings,
[02:23.36]We joyously spread all abroad.
[02:37.72]Eternal rejoicing approaches,
[02:42.20]Like daylight that follows the night.
[02:47.13]The promised new earth and new heavens
[02:51.83]Will bring everlasting delight.
[02:53.58](Chorus)
[02:55.33]Jehovah our God is our joy,
[02:59.93]The work of his hands our delight.
[03:04.46]How deep are his thoughts, how great are his works,
[03:09.02]Abounding in goodness and might!